{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_033sih0114_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_033sih0114_1000_p", "source_sha256": "d141ff31dd39539dc0acf7255e616843d382f1535f4ffe0b7e5a19f1e2a9741e", "ja": "（志保のPV撮影が、無事終わった。\nこれは、いいPVになりそうだな……！）", "zh": "（志保的PV顺利拍摄完成了。\n感觉会是一支很棒的PV……！）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_033sih0114_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_033sih0114_1001_033sih", "source_sha256": "c19c35c35e3483ca437dbcb18c7ebde391118be7271e8ce485cf3edf0598fb43", "ja": "お疲れさまです、{$P$}さん。\nあの……どうでしたか？", "zh": "辛苦了，{$P$}先生。\n请问……你觉得如何呢？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_033sih0114_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_033sih0114_1002_p", "source_sha256": "a9dfd0ec903b2b48c9c04379c02903ab5afdb49f548dcb6f08eb9d84c2bd51f1", "ja": "お疲れさま、志保。うん、衣装も雰囲気に合っていたし\n演技もよかったと思う。完成が楽しみだな。", "zh": "辛苦了，志保。嗯，服装很符合氛围，\n你的演技也很棒，我很期待PV完成喔。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_033sih0114_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_033sih0114_1003_033sih", "source_sha256": "1ed9e3d96d2441153338449b149f667d6f77f762c319276921e7b28713dab10b", "ja": "そうですか、ありがとうございます。\n……他には、何かありませんか？", "zh": "是吗？谢谢你。\n……没有其他感想了吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_033sih0114_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_033sih0114_1004_p", "source_sha256": "d86c68e976a0ed8a55054b446a81dc73b2010b34a5b819a6f7fb42499e7dbca0", "ja": "他に？　……というと。", "zh": "其他感想……？你是指？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_033sih0114_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_033sih0114_1005_033sih", "source_sha256": "93a1acc0f3dd3721a8c41a0bf9236d5ad943038bceb8216772a0f600c3f49902", "ja": "いえ、特に気がつかなかったならいいんです。\nすみません。", "zh": "没事，如果没有特别在意的地方就算了。\n对不起。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_033sih0114_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_033sih0114_1006_p", "source_sha256": "652a250ef0863a910de550a809009ce61c37dedd7f6ec9ca001b4bc54cff668d", "ja": "そう言われると気になるな。\nいつもと違うところか……あ、あった気がする。", "zh": "你这么说反而让我更在意啊。\n是不同于平时的地方吗……啊，好像有喔。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_033sih0114_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_033sih0114_1007_033sih", "source_sha256": "a556600eb7cfa6690634f591bd7c9cc29734c25f831154978a79fe0e56cf0d0a", "ja": "本当ですか！　どういうところが？", "zh": "真的吗！？你觉得是哪里呢？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_033sih0114_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_033sih0114_1008_p", "source_sha256": "d60cbecdbbc7d22cf9b7cd85eea7ca772eb96ea67adf614231d371ba63cce498", "ja": "そうだな……今回は、特に入り込んでる感じがした。\nだから普段より、儚くて切ない雰囲気が出てたと思う。", "zh": "这个嘛……我觉得你这次特别投入。\n所以相较于平时，更多出了一种飘渺悲伤的氛围。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_033sih0114_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_033sih0114_1009_033sih", "source_sha256": "2fd486ec427c8c318991653999ba571a3981cfacf9309555e271832b3324de70", "ja": "そうですか。よかった……。", "zh": "这样啊，那就太好了……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_033sih0114_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_033sih0114_1010_p", "source_sha256": "2e5b89c0ba3836e2f96e79996bdd9a36046c721a9e2b31696856297d7fdf5b68", "ja": "志保、撮影の時に何か考えてたのか？", "zh": "志保，你在拍摄时有什么想法吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_033sih0114_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_033sih0114_1011_033sih", "source_sha256": "b75decd8f9034d71453501176563658d36c3fbf4dfa516471270568de1bbd479", "ja": "はい。今回は雪やオーロラのステージだったので、\n自分なりに、いろいろ考えてみたんです。", "zh": "有的，因为这次的舞台主题是雪与极光，\n所以我自己思考了很多。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_033sih0114_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_033sih0114_1012_033sih", "source_sha256": "1dc426425631e292062f8c59d496dbf31fa8e524d830ccb57775a970e2f2de9d", "ja": "雪もオーロラも、とても綺麗ですけど。\nすぐに消えてしまう、儚いものだから。", "zh": "雪和极光都很美丽，\n但稍纵即逝，是很飘渺的存在。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_033sih0114_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_033sih0114_1013_033sih", "source_sha256": "f79f06b7c1ac882eadee14ba1844b1028e3d8dfbaa4563862e78a1b574a7a975", "ja": "せめて歌声は、消えてしまわないように……\nすこしでも残せるように。そんな気持ちをこめました。", "zh": "所以至少不能让歌声消逝……哪怕只残留一些也好。\n这就是我在拍摄中的心情。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_033sih0114_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_033sih0114_1014_p", "source_sha256": "9852a2b91e146ee01cda37251e8e4898881699177f520729cbf9ee8c202792aa", "ja": "なるほど。その気持ちは伝わってきたと思う。\nきっと見てくれた人にも、伝わるんじゃないかな。", "zh": "原来如此，我认为这样的想法有传达出来。\n观看PV的人一定也能感受到吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_033sih0114_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_033sih0114_1015_033sih", "source_sha256": "da2fb8b22d6a7638bc788389059b62be2b4d408700e1ae6f05cdfbd57ace46b2", "ja": "ありがとうございます。\n……そうだといいんですけど。", "zh": "谢谢你。\n……希望如此。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_033sih0114_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_033sih0114_1016_p", "source_sha256": "eced7564b5d8eadc1773068bb69850e095145f84d4219831a7f905e50ae06084", "ja": "大丈夫だよ。\n完成を楽しみにしていよう。", "zh": "没问题的。\n一起期待PV完成吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_033sih0114_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_033sih0114_1017_033sih", "source_sha256": "47be686a269b4acf59bb876f2e3af3b9202cee6f7b4dab505e60d6c24427d8b5", "ja": "ありがとうございます。今回うまくできたのは、\n{$P$}さんのおかげです。", "zh": "谢谢你。这次之所以能顺利成功，\n都要感谢{$P$}先生。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_033sih0114_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_033sih0114_1018_p", "source_sha256": "b6fc87449ee659eb9e0b27522f88a8e88118715928ccae755940971eeb29e4f4", "ja": "俺の……何かしたっけ？", "zh": "感谢我……我有做了什么吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_033sih0114_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_033sih0114_1019_033sih", "source_sha256": "c6ae76d318ff8a814d73e51b9b59a81589d0bf55f66dd146b0a5afdd96bbc7b8", "ja": "はい。このPVの打ち合わせの前に、カフェに\n連れて行ってもらって。……なんだかホッとしました。", "zh": "有的，参加这支PV的会议之前，\n你带我去了咖啡厅……让我心情放松不少。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_033sih0114_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_033sih0114_1020_033sih", "source_sha256": "232fb1060bc54984ac176ce9395c1f2122f7512b7f98500535d17ae2ea84f2ed", "ja": "ココアは、飲んでなくなってしまいましたけど。\nその時の気持ちは、私の中に残っているので。", "zh": "虽然热可可已经喝完了，\n但那时的感受，依旧留在我的心中。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_033sih0114_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_033sih0114_1021_033sih", "source_sha256": "14e4ae13ad65e873085674ea628b9b1da2330f68ab5bba00bd62741665ce244c", "ja": "なので……ありがとうございました。", "zh": "所以……真的很感谢你。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_033sih0114_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_033sih0114_1022_p", "source_sha256": "7693cb986ea65f8da66ba5626af690c9ac8e25165e83fd0364fa2ef71c347caa", "ja": "志保……。", "zh": "志保……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_033sih0114_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_033sih0114_1023_033sih", "source_sha256": "d624cf3bb5b5bd3b52fe9c2d51eaab60af6546d732c852a2b4c7ab5e6ccf2c1e", "ja": "あっ……じ、じゃあ私、着替えてきますね。\n失礼します。", "zh": "啊……那、那么我先去换衣服。\n失陪了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
